  "title": "Ignition Cut",
  "user_description": "Adds an independent ignition-cut limiter with adjustable RPM hysteresis and fixed injector pulse width while cutting. Launch Control V6 can use the same installed cut engine without depending on this limiter's runtime switch.",
  "description": "MS41.3 Ignition Cut V8. E812.0 owns the standalone limiter request and E812.1 is reserved for Launch Control V6; the final-stage gate cuts when either request is active. CUTSW and CUTRPM control only the standalone requester. CUT_HYST is RPM/32 (FF preserves zero-hysteresis legacy behavior), and CUT_IPW is uint16 x0.00534 ms (FFFF preserves stock injection). While E812.0/.1/.2 reports a real cut, trim stores pause and front/rear O2-voltage, catalyst, misfire, and coil/resistor monitors take their stock disabled/neutral cleanup paths; O2-heater electrical monitoring stays active.",
